{"id":"7c3e3d72ee35c3e0","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-extension-theory.md","title":"Extension of a Theory","display":"df-extension-theory — Extension of a Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-extension-theory","aliases":["92-df-extension-theory"],"display":"df-extension-theory — Extension of a Theory","depends_on":["[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-universal-closure]]","[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]"],"source":"本地理论闭包背景；第 V–VI 章涉及系统扩展","source_status":"原书相关概念的本地定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-extension-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-extension-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-extension-theory — Extension of a Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"302b3328b775d21b\" href=\"?note=302b3328b775d21b\" title=\"92-df-universal-closure\">92-df-universal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89c266445c099752\" href=\"?note=89c266445c099752\" title=\"92-ax-peano-arithmetic\">92-ax-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论闭包背景；第 V–VI 章涉及系统扩展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关概念的本地定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G\\)</span> (theory parameters and predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ext}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ext}_G\\)</span> (definition-target extension predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}theory} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_G(T_2,T_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T_1)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T_2)\\land T_1\\subseteq T_2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}theory} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_G(T_2,T_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T_1)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T_2)\\land T_1\\subseteq T_2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理论扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2 \\supseteq T_1\">\\(T_2 \\supseteq T_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>的定理也是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span>的定理</li>\n<li>一致扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span>一致且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2 \\supseteq T_1\">\\(T_2 \\supseteq T_1\\)</span></li>\n<li>保守扩展：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_2\">\\(T_2\\)</span>不证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1\">\\(T_1\\)</span>语言中的新定理</li>\n<li>本定义的参数是已闭合理论，所以准确例子是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}])\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}])\\)</span>扩展<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(Q)\\)</span>，而不是把两个原始公理集直接代入</li>\n<li>加一致性句的例子应写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\})\\)</span>扩展<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}])\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}])\\)</span>，并区分内部一致性句与外部谓词</li>\n<li>只有当扩展仍有效可公理化、相容且保留足够算术强度时，不完备性定理才推出它仍不完备</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"302b3328b775d21b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"68f172d58c15e75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ and $\\mathrm{Theory}_G$ (theory parameters and predicate, see [[92-df-theory]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ext}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}extension\\text{-}theory} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ext}_G(T_2,T_1)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T_1)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T_2)\\land T_1\\subseteq T_2","display":true},{"tex":"T_2 \\supseteq T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_2 \\supseteq T_1","display":false},{"tex":"T_2","display":false},{"tex":"T_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}])","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]\\cup\\{\\mathrm{Con}_G\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_G(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}])","display":false}],"bytes":1630,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-extension-theory]]"}],"outgoing":["87dbd27955ecb3b6","302b3328b775d21b","89c266445c099752","468d35690d25ee42","68f172d58c15e75d"]}